SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    Cu 10e-3
    Ba 5e-3

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -formula CaCO3 1
        -m0 1.0
        -m    1.0
        -parms 10 1.0
        -steps 10*100
        -cvode

RATES
Calcite
-start
10 rate_const = PARM(1)
20 surf_area = PARM(2)
30 moles = rate_const * surf_area * TIME
40 SAVE moles
-end

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selout.txt
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -pH true
